OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain this evening
OL,7,Faccompanied by a fresh to strong
OL,8,Fwesterly wind. Turning clearer by
OL,9,Fmidnight, with just one or two showers
OL,10,Ffollowing overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA much brighter day with some
OL,13,Fsunny intervals. There will also be a
OL,14,Ffew pasisng showers. Fresh to strong
OL,15,Fsouthwesterly winds veering westerly
OL,16,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
