OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FSunny
OL,6,Fintervals and a few showers on Monday,
OL,7,Fbreezy. Mainly dry on Tuesday then
OL,8,Fchance of a few showers on Wednesday,
OL,9,Fthough turning warmer.
